The pattern follows here is;

(First Number)² × Second Number = Third Number

In (6, 17, 612);

6² × 17 

= 36 × 17

= 612

Similarly;

In (7, 15, 735);

7² × 15 

= 49 × 15

= 735

Hence, **"(7, 15, 735)"** is the correct answer.

